###
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients/me/prescriptions
Accept: application/json

### 7.5 Intento de consultar recetas sin autenticación
### -> DEBE RETORNAR 401 UNAUTHORIZED
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients/me/prescriptions
Accept: application/json
